# A sibling of the tip that fails ConnectBlock, stored below the main chain, then a header on
# it; invalidating the main block under the sibling connects it and it fails, leaving the
# header-only child unmarked: a header on that child (AcceptBlockHeader#6).
extend main 2
mutate cb_amount
fork 2 1
extend b1 1 headers hold
invalidate main@-1
extend b1 1 headers
